    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d909">

                <pb facs="0892" n="780" xml:id="pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860 E.00/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-21T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 21,
                                1919—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3512. For Polk.</p>
                <p>Your 4700, October 17, 4 p.m. Can you ascertain details of supposed transaction
                    between Ukrainian Mission and American military authorities? I believe this
                    matter should be thoroughly investigated.</p>
                <p>Department desires to have promptly any information obtained by American Red
                    Cross representatives in the Ukraine concerning the condition of the Jews and
                    the practicability of relief. Jewish relief organization in this country has
                    ample funds.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
